Description: Add locale stub and disable ThinLTO for protoc-gen-js
 protoc-gen-js is a build tool that generates JavaScript bindings from
 Protocol Buffer files. It requires locale symbols from libc++ for iostream
 initialization, but the bundled libc++'s locale.cpp cannot be compiled on
 Debian due to type conflicts with glibc headers.
 .
 Missing symbols: std::__Cr::locale::*, std::__Cr::num_put::id,
 std::__Cr::ctype::id, __cxa_guard_*, __cxa_pure_virtual
 .
 This patch:
 1. Adds a minimal stub implementation (cef_locale_stub.cpp) that provides
    the necessary locale symbols for linking. Since protoc-gen-js is a build
    tool that runs with LC_ALL=C and only outputs generated code, it doesn't
    need actual locale functionality.
 2. Disables ThinLTO for protoc-gen-js to prevent symbol stripping.
    LTO removes the entire stub object file during optimization because no code
    directly references the symbols (they're needed only at link time).
 .
 Build 135: locale.cpp compilation proven impossible (__newlocale conflicts)
 Build 163c-164: System libc++ failed (ABI namespace mismatch __Cr vs __1)
 Build 165-170: Stub approach successful, but LTO stripped all symbols
 Build 171: Config removal failed (thinlto_optimize_default only controls level)
 Build 172: Direct flag override with -fno-lto (overrides config("compiler"))
 .
 Investigation: build/config/compiler/BUILD.gn:828,876 adds -flto=thin in the
 main config("compiler") block. Later flags override earlier ones in GN/Clang.
Author: Juan Manuel Méndez Rey <vejeta@gmail.com>
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/915400
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2025-11-14

--- a/third_party/protobuf-javascript/BUILD.gn
+++ b/third_party/protobuf-javascript/BUILD.gn
@@ -12,6 +12,18 @@ if (current_toolchain == host_toolchain
       "src/generator/well_known_types_embed.cc",
       "src/generator/well_known_types_embed.h",
     ]
+
+    # Debian: Add locale stub for linking (avoids locale.cpp compilation issues)
+    sources += [
+      "//cef/debian/cef_locale_stub.cpp",
+    ]
+
+    # Disable ThinLTO to prevent symbol stripping from stub
+    # Stub provides locale symbols needed at link time but not referenced in code
+    # config("compiler") adds -flto=thin globally, we override with -fno-lto
+    # Investigation: build/config/compiler/BUILD.gn:828,876 adds -flto=thin in config("compiler")
+    # Later flags override earlier ones in GN/Clang, so -fno-lto disables ThinLTO
+    cflags += [ "-fno-lto" ]
+    ldflags += [ "-fno-lto" ]
+
     include_dirs = [ "src" ]
     deps = [
       "//third_party/protobuf:protoc_lib",
